# TOEIC Vocabulary - Day16

| Word    | Meaning | Example                                |
| ------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |
| approve | 승인하다    | The manager approved the proposal.     |
| submit  | 제출하다    | Please submit the form by Friday.      |
| extend  | 연장하다    | We decided to extend the deadline.     |
| inform  | 알리다     | Please inform us of any changes.       |
| attend  | 참석하다    | All employees must attend the meeting. |

